---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import "../styles/about-page.css";
---

<PageLayout
  title="About — Stacks Magazine"
  description="About Stacks Magazine and its staff."
>
  <div class="about-wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      {/* About & mission */}
      <div class="about-left">
        <header class="section-header">
          <h1>About <i>Stacks</i></h1>
        </header>

        <div class="about-mission">
          <p>
            Berkeley began as an offshoot of San Francisco, an intimate neighbor
            to industrial Oakland and, of course, a college town. Home to the
            University of California, the city has made a name for itself as a
            hotbed of intellectual thought and subcultural social movements.
          </p>
          <p>
            The Daily Californian serves to inform its readers of the city's
            going-ons and contextualize the confusion of daily campus life. The
            paper, however, represents more than just the campus's 30,000
            undergraduates or the city's 120,000 residents. We are Berkeley's
            paper of record and its only remaining regular print publication.
          </p>
          <p>
            As such, the Daily Cal is launching <i>Stacks</i> to look deeper into
            the swirling maze of innovation and drudgery that underpins our campus
            and our city. From this, our name is derived. Main Stacks library: a place
            synonymous with the Berkeley experience in its magnitude, knowledge and
            chaotic order.
          </p>
          <p>
            In <i>Stacks</i>, we aim to represent all walks of life — from
            aspiring beatniks and future dropouts-turned-CEOs to our red-eyed
            engineers, pedantic writers and California blondes.
          </p>
          <p>
            <i>Stacks</i> is an archive of Berkeley as it is, as we think it is and
            as we want it to be.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Masthead */}
      <div class="about-right">
        <header class="section-header">
          <h1>Staff</h1>
        </header>

        <section class="masthead-section">
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Editor-in-Chief</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name">Ananya Rupanagunta</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Managing Editor</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name">Chrissa Olson</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Creative Director</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name">Sally King</span
            >
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="masthead-section">
          <h2>Editors</h2>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Magazine Managing Editor</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name">Clara Brownstein</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Editors</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name">Elise Fisher & Sam Grotenstein</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Contributing Editors</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name">Elsa Ying & Milo Kofman</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Night Editors</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name"
              >Caroline Hunt, Ella Kirshbaum, Kelcie Lee, Megan Lam & Serene Han</span
            >
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="masthead-section">
          <h2>Creative</h2>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Graphics editor</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name">Eleanor Robertson</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Photo editor</span>: <span
              class="masthead-name">Ahana Sur</span
            >
          </p>
          <br />
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Website by</span>
            <span class="masthead-name"
              ><a href="https://www.ocf.berkeley.edu/~joever/portfoli0_o"
                >Joever Orillosa</a
              >, Siddhartha Chatterjee</span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Logo by</span>
            <span class="masthead-name"
              ><a href="https://alyssa-nguyen.xyz">Alyssa Nguyen</a></span
            >
          </p>
          <p class="masthead-pair">
            <span class="masthead-role">Founding Editors:</span>
            <span class="masthead-name"
              >Clara Brownstein, Ananya Rupanagunta, Aarya Mukherjee, Elise
              Fisher, Sam Grotenstein & Stella Merims</span
            >
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Submit */}
    <div class="mission-statement">
      <h2>Submit</h2>
      <p>
        To pitch or submit work to <i>Stacks</i> email <a
          href="mailto:stacks@dailycal.org">stacks@dailycal.org</a
        >. We're looking for commentaries, essays, reviews, satires, and more.
        We especially love work that highlights new or misunderstood aspects of
        Berkeley and the Bay Area.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
